WEBVTT

00:01:30.490 --> 00:01:32.680
Go Shoot!

00:01:37.490 --> 00:01:39.530
I'm gonna push you out!

00:01:42.550 --> 00:01:45.440
This'll end it! Go, Dragoon!

00:01:46.700 --> 00:01:47.700
He dodged it!

00:01:48.770 --> 00:01:50.840
He fooled me.

00:01:50.840 --> 00:01:53.170
But you won't
get away this time!

00:01:55.620 --> 00:01:56.660
Darn!

00:01:57.150 --> 00:02:00.850
I think there's a thing or
two I need to teach you.

00:02:01.730 --> 00:02:05.030
You can't win with your own strength!

00:02:05.030 --> 00:02:06.160
What?!

00:02:06.160 --> 00:02:08.470
I won't lose to you!

00:02:26.400 --> 00:02:27.650
I don't get it.

00:02:28.120 --> 00:02:31.270
Why did I lose back there?

00:02:32.160 --> 00:02:33.360
That light...

00:02:33.680 --> 00:02:36.640
No, that might not have been light.

00:02:37.080 --> 00:02:40.100
That was a weird power I've never seen before.

00:02:42.420 --> 00:02:45.900
If you want revenge, I'll take
you on whenever you want.

00:02:46.800 --> 00:02:49.710
Who the heck is he?

00:02:52.220 --> 00:02:54.470
Darn it!

00:02:54.470 --> 00:02:56.400
It's been a while since I've felt this way.

00:02:56.400 --> 00:02:59.190
Next time I see him I'm gonna--

00:03:00.800 --> 00:03:02.480
You're wide open!

00:03:04.620 --> 00:03:07.600
Ouch!

00:03:08.680 --> 00:03:10.240
You've gotten soft, Takao!

00:03:10.240 --> 00:03:16.580
Did you forget that a swordsman must
always be ready for an enemy's attack?

00:03:16.580 --> 00:03:19.770
But I'm not a swordsman...

00:03:20.690 --> 00:03:22.560
What's your problem
so early in the morning?

00:03:22.560 --> 00:03:27.600
Fool! There aren't enough hours in the day for you to inhert this dojo!

00:03:27.600 --> 00:03:31.500
It's fine, right? This is more
important to me, anyway.

00:03:34.200 --> 00:03:37.370
You got your mind wrapped around those top games again, don't you?

00:03:37.370 --> 00:03:41.200
That's why you've
been so distracted.

00:03:41.200 --> 00:03:42.540
Distracted?

00:03:42.900 --> 00:03:46.690
That's why you didn't dodge my shinai.

00:03:46.690 --> 00:03:49.600
"I'm strong. I don't intend on losing."

00:03:49.810 --> 00:03:53.330
You're unconsciously distracting
yourself with thoughts like those.

00:03:53.580 --> 00:03:57.360
Accept these distractions
and you'll never win.

00:03:59.220 --> 00:04:00.490
Right...

00:04:00.490 --> 00:04:02.240
You might have a point.

00:04:05.350 --> 00:04:09.520
So how can I stay focused?

00:04:10.450 --> 00:04:13.470
Discipline your mind.

00:04:14.920 --> 00:04:17.360
Discipline my mind...

00:04:22.770 --> 00:04:24.950
Now that he's distracted...

00:04:25.150 --> 00:04:27.930
Your stomach is vulnerable!

00:04:33.520 --> 00:04:36.170
Like I said, don't drop your guar--

00:04:44.560 --> 00:04:46.240
I'm gonna be late so I'm off.

00:04:46.240 --> 00:04:48.930
Thanks for the good advice.

00:04:50.290 --> 00:04:52.870
My favorite flower vase...

00:05:05.960 --> 00:05:09.780
Takao got annihilated yesterday!

00:05:10.420 --> 00:05:11.630
Takao lost?

00:05:11.630 --> 00:05:12.220
For real?

00:05:12.220 --> 00:05:15.900
What? You couldn't have missed it!

00:05:15.900 --> 00:05:21.120
The guy who beat him was in this weird
getup but he was a super strong Blader!

00:05:21.120 --> 00:05:24.650
Yeah! Dragoon got blown
out in the blink of an eye!

00:05:24.650 --> 00:05:26.270
Everyone was like "no way"!

00:05:26.270 --> 00:05:28.320
I wish I was there!

00:05:28.880 --> 00:05:31.150
That's enough already!

00:05:32.010 --> 00:05:34.000
We all know Takao lost.

00:05:34.000 --> 00:05:35.840
Completely destroyed, even.

00:05:35.840 --> 00:05:40.030
But have any of you thought
about how Takao feels?

00:05:41.380 --> 00:05:44.280
I'm sure he's hurt.

00:05:45.450 --> 00:05:47.760
As a champion member of the BBA,

00:05:47.760 --> 00:05:50.200
as the boy who stood atop the world,

00:05:50.200 --> 00:05:52.850
he lost to some no-name Blader!

00:05:53.080 --> 00:05:57.080
I'm sure he's shocked beyond belief.

00:05:59.490 --> 00:06:00.830
Oh crap!

00:06:00.830 --> 00:06:02.450
So please.

00:06:02.450 --> 00:06:06.610
Don't talk about yesterday's
match in front of Takao.

00:06:06.610 --> 00:06:07.860
Is that okay?

00:06:07.860 --> 00:06:08.930
Understood.

00:06:08.930 --> 00:06:10.100
We'll be careful.

00:06:10.100 --> 00:06:13.040
Now, students, take your seats please.

00:06:13.040 --> 00:06:14.090
Stand!

00:06:15.640 --> 00:06:16.480
Bow!

00:06:16.630 --> 00:06:18.980
--Good morning!

00:06:19.040 --> 00:06:20.690
Good morning.

00:06:25.150 --> 00:06:26.530
Where's Mr. Kinomiya?

00:06:28.230 --> 00:06:29.760
I'm safe!

00:06:29.760 --> 00:06:31.450
Man, that was close!

00:06:31.450 --> 00:06:33.700
Just a little longer and I'd have been late!

00:06:33.700 --> 00:06:34.800
You are late!

00:06:36.490 --> 00:06:39.240
What's the problem, Hiromi? I made it didn't I?

00:06:39.240 --> 00:06:40.960
Once the bell rings, you're late!

00:06:40.960 --> 00:06:41.930
You're <b><i>out.</i></b>

00:06:42.300 --> 00:06:44.140
You're so irresponsible.

00:06:44.140 --> 00:06:47.180
You skipped out on
cleaning duty yesterday.

00:06:47.840 --> 00:06:50.190
I had important stuff to--

00:06:50.190 --> 00:06:52.240
What's so important about tops?

00:06:52.240 --> 00:06:54.290
And you got your butt whooped, right?

00:06:54.840 --> 00:06:56.480
Don't say that...!

00:06:56.850 --> 00:07:00.080
I heard you got beat in one shot
by a guy some weird clothes.

00:07:00.080 --> 00:07:03.770
That's what you get for skipping
out on your class duties.

00:07:05.230 --> 00:07:06.320
You little...

00:07:06.320 --> 00:07:07.500
You crossed the line!

00:07:07.500 --> 00:07:08.590
What?

00:07:08.940 --> 00:07:11.290
Mr. Kinomiya... Ms. Tachibana...

00:07:11.290 --> 00:07:13.280
Calm down!

00:07:18.300 --> 00:07:20.490
Yup. I lost.

00:07:21.870 --> 00:07:25.330
And a loss is a loss.

00:07:25.330 --> 00:07:29.300
But next time I'm definitely going to win.

00:07:29.300 --> 00:07:32.590
That's all I'm thinking about right now.

00:07:32.590 --> 00:07:33.420
Takao...

00:07:33.620 --> 00:07:36.210
Yeah, you just have to win next time!

00:07:38.030 --> 00:07:41.050
Can I start class now?

00:07:43.710 --> 00:07:48.350
I tried to find where this Mister
X is from and where he went.

00:07:48.710 --> 00:07:50.250
It's a total mystery.

00:07:50.580 --> 00:07:51.840
Darn it!

00:07:51.840 --> 00:07:54.370
I want to fight him again.

00:07:54.370 --> 00:07:59.360
I think we should prioritize analyzing the footage from that battle between Dragoon and his Bey

00:07:59.360 --> 00:08:02.570
so that we have a countermeasure when you have your rematch.

00:08:02.570 --> 00:08:03.620
Well?

00:08:04.060 --> 00:08:07.220
Some unknown noise came in
at the most important moment,

00:08:07.220 --> 00:08:08.910
so I can't analyze it.

00:08:09.360 --> 00:08:11.010
Here, take a look.

00:08:15.080 --> 00:08:16.990
Did your camera break?

00:08:16.990 --> 00:08:18.800
It's not the camera!

00:08:18.800 --> 00:08:21.030
I just said it was unknown, didn't I?

00:08:21.030 --> 00:08:23.020
You don't have to get mad...

00:08:23.870 --> 00:08:26.210
You're not the only
one upset about losing.

00:08:26.210 --> 00:08:27.210
So am I...

00:08:27.800 --> 00:08:29.020
Kyoujyu...

00:08:29.210 --> 00:08:30.160
Sorry.

00:08:30.160 --> 00:08:31.990
I'm counting on you.

00:08:32.750 --> 00:08:33.740
I know.

00:08:39.440 --> 00:08:41.980
It's not just my problem.

00:08:42.160 --> 00:08:45.710
Damn. I'm gonna beat him for sure next time!

00:08:45.710 --> 00:08:48.570
If I don't, how can I
show my face to them?

00:08:48.570 --> 00:08:49.920
Them?

00:09:00.700 --> 00:09:01.550
Hey.

00:09:01.990 --> 00:09:05.380
You're Max, right? The world champion?

00:09:05.380 --> 00:09:07.310
Yeah, do you need something?

00:09:07.550 --> 00:09:09.030
Could you do me a favor?

00:09:09.030 --> 00:09:11.580
An autograph? My pleasure.

00:09:11.580 --> 00:09:12.480
No.

00:09:13.320 --> 00:09:15.780
Could you have a battle with me, please?

00:09:20.960 --> 00:09:22.350
Please.

00:09:22.470 --> 00:09:26.700
Okay. But I don't hold
back against the ladies.

00:09:28.110 --> 00:09:29.420
Then, here we go.

00:09:30.030 --> 00:09:32.560
Go Shoot!

00:09:35.630 --> 00:09:37.310
Attack whenever you like.

00:09:47.630 --> 00:09:48.920
No way!

00:09:54.960 --> 00:09:57.940
Relax your wrists a little more,
and pull as hard as you can.

00:09:57.950 --> 00:09:58.960
Try it.

00:09:59.950 --> 00:10:02.080
Go Shoot!

00:10:05.290 --> 00:10:06.400
I did it!

00:10:06.400 --> 00:10:07.760
That was good.

00:10:07.760 --> 00:10:08.960
I'm next!

00:10:08.960 --> 00:10:10.010
No, I'm next!

00:10:10.010 --> 00:10:11.450
Show me!

00:10:12.000 --> 00:10:13.560
You've got company!

00:10:27.310 --> 00:10:29.250
Go Shoot!

00:11:06.250 --> 00:11:08.810
Nothing wrong with my laptop...

00:11:09.440 --> 00:11:12.400
So what was that noise?

00:11:20.180 --> 00:11:21.540
That's...!

00:11:35.350 --> 00:11:38.080
I knew it. That's the mysterious
boy who beat Takao.

00:12:07.010 --> 00:12:09.330
That was my best chance...

00:12:13.260 --> 00:12:16.180
What?! You found him?

00:12:16.180 --> 00:12:18.490
I was so close,

00:12:18.490 --> 00:12:20.190
but I lost him.

00:12:20.640 --> 00:12:23.400
Okay, so he's still in town.

00:12:23.840 --> 00:12:26.750
If I only could have followed
him to his hideout...

00:12:26.750 --> 00:12:31.280
Just seeing him is a huge help!

00:12:31.280 --> 00:12:34.790
Darn, now I'm pumped!

00:12:34.790 --> 00:12:36.940
One-two, one-two, one-two...

00:12:36.940 --> 00:12:38.000
What are you doing?

00:12:38.000 --> 00:12:39.560
Training!

00:12:39.560 --> 00:12:42.710
I need strength for my revenge match.

00:12:42.710 --> 00:12:44.040
I see...

00:12:50.040 --> 00:12:51.620
Why the sudden scream?

00:12:51.620 --> 00:12:54.370
I got an e-mail from Max in America.

00:12:54.370 --> 00:12:56.380
There's a picture attached, too.

00:12:56.620 --> 00:12:58.320
Oh, it's just Max.

00:12:58.320 --> 00:13:01.090
Did he send a video of
him showing off his family?

00:13:01.090 --> 00:13:03.060
"Takao, Kyoujyu, listen to this."

00:13:03.060 --> 00:13:05.280
"We've got incredible opponents on our hands."

00:13:05.280 --> 00:13:08.480
"My Draciel lost in an instant."

00:13:08.480 --> 00:13:10.350
What? Draciel did?

00:13:10.990 --> 00:13:12.680
Here's the playback.

00:13:37.170 --> 00:13:39.080
It's the same thing as my battle.

00:13:39.080 --> 00:13:40.200
Takao...

00:13:40.810 --> 00:13:42.060
Kyoujyu.

00:13:42.060 --> 00:13:44.850
Is this just a coincidence? Or...?

00:13:45.400 --> 00:13:48.780
Right now, we can only
think of it as such.

00:13:48.980 --> 00:13:53.010
You and Max coincidentally fought and lost the same kind of battle

00:13:53.010 --> 00:13:56.110
against the same kind of
enemy around the same time.

00:13:56.190 --> 00:13:59.180
Don't you think that's
too many coincidences?

00:13:59.180 --> 00:14:01.480
I can't believe it either!

00:14:01.750 --> 00:14:06.080
In order to thoroughly
analyze this video Max sent,

00:14:06.880 --> 00:14:09.400
Darn!!

00:14:21.950 --> 00:14:23.280
Why?

00:14:23.850 --> 00:14:26.740
Why did me and Max...
at the same time...?

00:14:27.230 --> 00:14:28.280
And plus,

00:14:28.280 --> 00:14:30.300
in the same way...

00:14:31.370 --> 00:14:32.910
I don't get it.

00:14:33.140 --> 00:14:34.520
I don't get it!

00:14:39.790 --> 00:14:41.600
Who can solve this problem?

00:14:41.780 --> 00:14:42.480
Here!

00:14:42.480 --> 00:14:43.940
Go ahead, Ms. Tachibana.

00:14:45.020 --> 00:14:47.520
I don't get it!!

00:14:47.520 --> 00:14:48.980
Oh boy...

00:14:48.980 --> 00:14:50.320
What?

00:14:50.420 --> 00:14:53.910
Takao, no one asked you!

00:14:56.480 --> 00:14:59.800
Were you sleeping in class again?

00:15:00.290 --> 00:15:02.360
No, you see, the thing is...

00:15:07.950 --> 00:15:09.110
Ms. Keiko!

00:15:11.820 --> 00:15:13.120
Ms. Tachibana.

00:15:13.800 --> 00:15:17.430
As class president,
I can't allow Takao's behavior.

00:15:17.780 --> 00:15:19.950
What do you think, Ms. Keiko?

00:15:20.710 --> 00:15:23.680
My class just isn't good enough.

00:15:23.690 --> 00:15:27.940
No, not that! At worst, it's too easy-
going, so we can't focus!

00:15:27.940 --> 00:15:30.150
But I have a solution.

00:15:33.750 --> 00:15:35.630
Do you have anything yet?

00:15:35.630 --> 00:15:38.480
I can't analyze it so easily.

00:15:38.630 --> 00:15:40.180
Just a little longer.

00:15:40.180 --> 00:15:43.690
I'm gonna lose sleep over this
if you don't finish analyzing it!

00:15:43.690 --> 00:15:46.870
I was up all night
last night, you know!

00:15:48.420 --> 00:15:49.600
Jeez.

00:15:51.050 --> 00:15:52.420
Hey, Manabu!

00:15:52.420 --> 00:15:54.460
What're you sitting around here, for?

00:15:55.120 --> 00:15:56.080
Kyoujyu's mom!

00:15:56.080 --> 00:15:58.870
Mother, what are you doing here?

00:15:58.870 --> 00:16:01.610
Delivering an order to the principal.

00:16:01.740 --> 00:16:04.460
More importantly, didn't
I tell you to hurry home

00:16:04.460 --> 00:16:07.120
after school to help with the store?

00:16:07.680 --> 00:16:09.740
I'm busy!

00:16:10.820 --> 00:16:13.100
What am I going to do with you?

00:16:13.590 --> 00:16:16.800
By the way, there's
mail for you at home.

00:16:16.800 --> 00:16:18.640
From someone named "Rei".

00:16:19.100 --> 00:16:20.040
Rei...

00:16:20.280 --> 00:16:23.050
It's not everyday we
get a letter from him.

00:16:23.430 --> 00:16:25.450
Hurry home!

00:16:27.770 --> 00:16:29.340
A letter from Rei...

00:16:29.760 --> 00:16:31.760
I wonder what it is?

00:16:31.760 --> 00:16:33.310
I have a bad feeling about this.

00:16:33.470 --> 00:16:34.500
I'm coming, too.

00:16:34.500 --> 00:16:36.350
Stop right there!

00:16:42.080 --> 00:16:44.160
Hiromi! And the ladies!

00:16:44.160 --> 00:16:46.090
What do you want?

00:16:46.090 --> 00:16:47.820
Can't you tell?

00:16:47.820 --> 00:16:51.760
We're going to make you clean
every last nook and cranny.

00:16:51.990 --> 00:16:54.080
You're not the boss of me!

00:16:54.080 --> 00:16:57.080
Of course, I asked Ms. Keiko beforehand.

00:16:57.080 --> 00:17:00.550
I'm going to be watching you like a hawk so you won't run away!

00:17:03.280 --> 00:17:04.420
Kyoujyu!

00:17:04.650 --> 00:17:07.200
I'm going to go see
what this letter's about!

00:17:07.360 --> 00:17:09.230
Hey, no fair!

00:17:11.380 --> 00:17:14.180
Why don't you give up
and come quietly, Takao?

00:17:23.230 --> 00:17:25.110
--I'm back!
--Welcome home!

00:17:32.740 --> 00:17:37.130
Kyoujyu, sorry that this is how
I contact you after so long.

00:17:38.170 --> 00:17:39.950
After returning to China,

00:17:40.200 --> 00:17:43.120
I suffered my first defeat.

00:17:44.060 --> 00:17:44.970
Rei...

00:17:46.790 --> 00:17:49.110
Go Shoot!

00:17:49.360 --> 00:17:52.640
I went up against a boy without knowing his name or where he was from.

00:17:52.640 --> 00:17:55.440
I'll admit that I let my guard down.

00:17:55.440 --> 00:17:57.790
But that was when...

00:18:10.800 --> 00:18:14.980
I felt a strange force that
I had never felt before.

00:18:15.770 --> 00:18:17.630
A strange force...

00:18:22.260 --> 00:18:25.580
The same kind of opponent
appeared before Rei.

00:18:25.580 --> 00:18:27.710
What's going on here?

00:18:33.740 --> 00:18:37.940
This is the only way I
can analyze this force.

00:18:39.320 --> 00:18:40.600
Wait!

00:18:41.530 --> 00:18:43.000
Like hell I'll wait!

00:18:43.000 --> 00:18:44.330
Give it up!

00:18:44.330 --> 00:18:46.390
You give up!

00:18:48.440 --> 00:18:50.240
You don't know
when to quit!

00:18:50.520 --> 00:18:52.240
Takao!

00:19:06.880 --> 00:19:07.670
Yeesh.

00:19:08.090 --> 00:19:10.190
I'm not gonna clean...

00:19:10.580 --> 00:19:12.340
Found you!

00:19:13.410 --> 00:19:14.360
Get back here!

00:19:14.360 --> 00:19:15.900
--You gotta be kidding me!
--Takao!

00:19:16.330 --> 00:19:17.680
Stop!

00:19:17.680 --> 00:19:19.070
Takao!

00:19:19.070 --> 00:19:20.830
Wait right there!

00:19:36.630 --> 00:19:39.220
We meet again, mystery boy.

00:19:39.900 --> 00:19:41.160
It's Ozma.

00:19:41.160 --> 00:19:42.560
Ozma?

00:19:45.510 --> 00:19:46.370
Takao?

00:19:52.810 --> 00:19:56.510
If I synchronize these
and compare the forces...

00:20:03.440 --> 00:20:04.910
I knew the noise would...

00:20:09.500 --> 00:20:10.710
It's here, too.

00:20:10.900 --> 00:20:11.980
Hold on...

00:20:12.320 --> 00:20:13.290
This is...!

00:20:26.120 --> 00:20:28.100
The noise has the same composition!

00:20:28.100 --> 00:20:31.220
This isn't just noise from the image.

00:20:31.220 --> 00:20:35.080
It's the same type of shock
from when I recorded it.

00:20:35.440 --> 00:20:36.530
Which means that...

00:20:39.320 --> 00:20:41.540
The mysterious light from that Bey...

00:20:41.540 --> 00:20:44.890
I may have found the
source of that strange force!

00:20:50.590 --> 00:20:52.910
Impossible...

00:20:53.180 --> 00:20:54.850
I can't believe it!

00:20:55.390 --> 00:20:57.450
This is a Sacred Beast!

00:20:57.450 --> 00:21:01.520
Was he controlling a
Sacred Beast we can't see?!

00:21:02.410 --> 00:21:03.340
Takao!

00:21:19.520 --> 00:21:21.270
All right, Ozma.

00:21:21.270 --> 00:21:22.480
Time for revenge!

00:21:22.960 --> 00:21:24.310
Let's do it!

00:22:56.100 --> 00:22:59.040
Takao has finally challenged Ozma again!

00:22:59.040 --> 00:23:01.060
There's more stuff after that,

00:23:01.060 --> 00:23:03.140
so please battle quickly!

00:23:03.140 --> 00:23:05.420
Wait, over already?

00:23:05.760 --> 00:23:07.300
Huh? Who won?

00:23:07.300 --> 00:23:09.620
I can tell them, right?

00:23:09.620 --> 00:23:13.280
This is why towards the end,
something awful happens to Hiromi...!

00:23:13.280 --> 00:23:15.560
No, I can't tell you.

00:23:15.560 --> 00:23:18.040
